  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h1>SASS Button Grammar: Homework Notebook</h1>\n",
    "<p><strong>Lesson:</strong> OCS SASS Button Grammar (<em>My Good Brain</em>)\n",
    "<strong>Contents:</strong> Popcorn Hacks 1-3 and Homework Hacks 1-2, all using only semantic tags (<code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;a&gt;</code>) plus OCS classes, with no inline styles.</p>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Popcorn Hack #1: Add the Base Button Class</h2>\n",
    "<p>Added <code>ocs__btn</code> to the empty <code>class=&quot;&quot;</code> so the link gets OCS button styling.</p>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-3",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "html"
    }
   },
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Buttons Popcorn 1 - Base Button Class -->\n",
    "<a class=\"ocs__btn\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\"> Mental Health Resource Directory</a>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Popcorn Hack #2: Modifiers &amp; Button Groups</h2>\n",
    "<ol>\n",
    "<li>Added <code>pill</code> and <code>fill</code> to the &quot;Complete Daily Check-In&quot; button (it keeps <code>accent</code>).</li>\n",
    "<li>Replaced the plain <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;div class=&quot;ocs__links&quot;&gt;</code> so both actions are grouped.</li>\n",
    "</ol>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Buttons Popcorn 2 - Modifiers & Button Groups -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__links\">\n",
    "  <button class=\"ocs__btn accent pill fill\">Complete Daily Check-In</button>\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn outline\" href=\"\">Save Draft Journal</a>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Popcorn Hack #3: Status Tones &amp; Wide Layout Bar</h2>\n",
    "<ol>\n",
    "<li>Changed the status tone from <code>alert-yellow</code> to <code>alert-green</code> on &quot;Complete Check-In&quot;</li>\n",
    "<li>Upgraded the container from <code>ocs__links</code> to <code>ocs__links--wide</code>.</li>\n",
    "<li>Added <code>fill</code> to the Crisis Support button for full visual priority.</li>\n",
    "</ol>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Buttons Popcorn 3 - Status Tones & Wide Layout -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__links--wide\">\n",
    "  <button class=\"ocs__btn alert-green outline\">Complete Check-In</button>\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn alert-red fill\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\"> Get Crisis Support</a>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Homework Hack #1: Adaptive Resource Toolbar</h2>\n",
    "<p>All three actions are wrapped in <code>ocs__links</code>, every inline <code>style</code> and hex/color word is gone, and each category uses the class set for its urgency:</p>\n",
    "<ul>\n",
    "<li><strong>Urgent Support:</strong> <code>ocs__btn alert-red fill pill</code></li>\n",
    "<li><strong>Self-Care:</strong> <code>ocs__btn alert-green fill pill</code></li>\n",
    "<li><strong>Community:</strong> <code>ocs__btn accent outline pill</code></li>\n",
    "</ul>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Buttons Homework 1 - Adaptive Resource Toolbar -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__links\">\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn alert-red fill pill\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\">Urgent Support</a>\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn alert-green fill pill\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\">Self-Care</a>\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn accent outline pill\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\">Community</a>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-10",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<h2>Homework Hack #2: Primary vs. Secondary Action Priority</h2>\n",
    "<p>Wrapped everything in <code>ocs__links</code>, removed all inline styles (including the outer <code>&lt;div&gt;</code>'s background/padding), and built a visual hierarchy:</p>\n",
    "<ul>\n",
    "<li><strong>Primary</strong> (&quot;Log Mood Entry&quot;): <code>ocs__btn accent fill</code>, the solid, highest-priority action.</li>\n",
    "<li><strong>Secondary</strong> (&quot;View Weekly Trends&quot;): <code>ocs__btn outline</code>, medium priority.</li>\n",
    "<li><strong>Alert</strong> (&quot;Crisis Hotline&quot;): <code>ocs__btn alert-red outline</code>, red so it stands out as urgent support without competing with the primary action.</li>\n",
    "</ul>\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "btn-hw-11",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "<!-- UI_RUNNER: Buttons Homework 2 - Primary vs. Secondary Action Priority -->\n",
    "<div class=\"ocs__links\">\n",
    "  <button class=\"ocs__btn accent fill\">Log Mood Entry</button>\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn outline\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\">View Weekly Trends</a>\n",
    "  <a class=\"ocs__btn alert-red outline\" href=\"https://www.mygoodbrain.org/resources\">Crisis Hotline</a>\n",
    "</div>"
   ]
  }
 ],
